# This root file only points to the authoritative examples.
# Copy each into place before running the app locally:
#   backend/.env.example  -> backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example -> frontend/.env
#
# There is no separate root .env — the backend reads WEAM_-prefixed variables
# from backend/.env, and Vite reads VITE_-prefixed variables from frontend/.env.
# See docs/LOCAL_SETUP.md for the full setup sequence.
